        {
          "id": "a1a89250-cdd3-4533-adf6-a641045ee834",
          "name": "Update a branch's image",
          "request": {
            "name": "Update a branch's image",
            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint uploads images to a <<glossary:branch>>. Available images and their image_keys, along with the supported file types and sizes are in the table below.\n\n> 🙇 Heads up!\n**All image file uploads should be base64 encoded.**\n<table border=1px cellpadding=5px>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<th>image_key</th>\n\t\t<th>Supported File Types</th>\n\t\t<th>Image Dimensions</th>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td>logo</td>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpeg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.png</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td>1000x313</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td>app_icon</td>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpeg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.png</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td>100x100</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td>app_homepage_logo</td>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpeg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.jpg</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>.png</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td>208x32</td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "branches",
                ":branch_id",
                "images",
                ":image_key"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<uuid>",
